#: zinn-chat.php
msgid "A fast, privacy-respecting live chat for your website. Answers visitors with AI when you are busy, hands them to you when they need a person, and emails you anything you miss. Under 5 KB on the page and no requests at all until somebody opens it."
msgstr "სwrafqi, confidencialobis damcveli cocxali cati tqveni veb-saitisTvis. is pasuxobs vizitorebis SekiTxvebs xelovnuri intelektit, roca dakavebuli xarT, gadascems maT Tqven, roca adamianis CarTvaa saWiro da gogzavniT el-fostam yvelafers, rac gamotoveT. gverdis zoma 5 KB-ze naklebia da arcerT moTxovnas ar agzavnis manam, sanam vincme ar gaxsnis."

